{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 19,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Job answered and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How long will ye vex my soul, and break me in pieces with words?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ten times have ye reproached me: ye are not ashamed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ye make yourselves strange to me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And be it indeed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I have erred, my error remaineth with myself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If indeed ye will magnify ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yourselves",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " against me, and plead against me my reproach:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Know now that God hath overthrown me, and hath encompassed me with his net.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, I cry out of wrong, but I am not heard: I cry aloud, but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no judgment.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath fenced up my way that I cannot pass, and he hath set darkness in my paths.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath stripped me of my glory, and taken the crown ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my head.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath destroyed me on every side, and I am gone: and my hope hath he removed like a tree.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath also kindled his wrath against me, and he counteth me to him as ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his enemies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His troops come together, and raise up their way against me, and encamp around my tabernacle.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath put my brethren far from me, and my acquaintance are verily estranged from me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My kinsmen have failed, and my familiar friends have forgotten me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that dwell in my house, and my maids, count me for a stranger: I am an alien in their sight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I called my servant, and he gave ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no answer; I entreated him with my mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My breath is strange to my wife, though I entreated for the children's ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "sake",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of my own body.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yes, young children despised me; I arose, and they spoke against me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All my intimate friends abhorred me: and they whom I loved are turned against me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My bone cleaveth to my skin and to my flesh, and I have escaped with the skin of my teeth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Have pity upon me, have pity upon me, O ye my friends; for the hand of God hath touched me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why do ye persecute me as God, and are not satisfied with my flesh?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh that my words were now written! oh that they were printed in a book!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That they were graven with an iron pen in lead, in the rock for ever!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I know ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my redeemer liveth, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he will stand at the latter ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "day",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the earth:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "though",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " after my skin ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "worms",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " destroy this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "body",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", yet in my flesh shall I see God:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whom I shall see for myself, and my eyes shall behold, and not another; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "though",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my reins be consumed within me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ye would say, Why persecute we him, seeing the root of the matter is found in me?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.19.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.19.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be ye afraid of the sword: for wrath ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "bringeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the punishments of the sword, that ye may know ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " is a judgment.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
